# Feature pipeline

When the user wants work done or a question about this repo, follow the IDE `run-workflow` skill first. Run `.pipeline/loader/load_workflow.py` and Read only `allowed_reads`.

Chains, skips, tracker settings, retry caps, and planning sign-off gates come from `.pipeline/config.json`. File packs live in `.pipeline/workflows/`. Feature class may run `architect-agent` after `@signoff:requirements`.

Product workflows: spawn **one new Task per agent**. `ask` stays in the parent. Never call tracker MCP from the parent.

Hooks: `.cursor/hooks.json` + `.cursor/hooks/*.py`. Skip when `CHORUS_TASK_ID` + `CHORUS_PORTAL` are set. See `.cursor/hooks/README.md`.
